<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Tigon moves to JSE banks, financial list.</title>
<headline>Tigon moves to JSE banks, financial list.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange has granted approval for the transfer of the listing of Tigon Ltd to the Financial-&quot;Banks and Financial Services&quot; sector from the &quot;Venture Capital&quot; sector.</p>
<p>The change of sector will become effective from January 13.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
